'''Platform 4''' was a landing platform for [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[TIE/ln space superiority starfighter|TIE fighters]] on the [[forest]] [[moon]] of [[Endor]]. Following the destruction of the [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station|second Death Star]] during the [[Battle of Endor]], [[Inferno Squad]] fought their way to the platform in order for them to evacuate the moon and rendezvous with [[Admiral]] [[Garrick Versio]].<ref name="Battlefront II" />

